+| sharp claim \(C_{\rm sup}=4/3\) | **VERDICT: UNSUPPORTED** | \(0.20\) |
+| A-SCALE | **VERDICT: WEAK EVIDENCE AGAINST** | \(0.40\) (rough range \(0.20\)--\(0.60\)) |
