+ \not\Rightarrow \text{unbounded A-SCALE failure}.                    \tag{2.4}
+\]
+
+**INTERNAL / UNREVIEWED, MOD-\(p\).** At D43 the commissioned 175-row
+graph-row ideal is nonempty at both primes, with a witnessed smooth
