+\[
+ \mathcal E_{\rm MR}
+ =\sum_P\frac{\Delta_P}{\alpha\beta}
+ =\sum_P\frac{\mu_P}{B}R_P,\qquad
+ \sum_P\frac{\mu_P}{B}=1,
+\]
+
+some root must have \(R_P\ge b\). This is unbounded DIR failure at exact
